PRODID:-//notapattern//calendar export 1.0//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:The Imaginary Invalid
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/The-Imaginary-Invalid-Tickets
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Imaginary Invalid
DTSTART:20261018T190000Z
DTEND:20261018T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261018T075209Z
UID:40478
DESCRIPTION:<p>Tony Award&reg\; winner Bill Irwin returns to Broadway (and
  to Moli&egrave\;re) to head the cast of his razor-sharp new adaptation of
  <em>The Imaginary Invalid</em>\, a comedy that proves hypochondria never 
 goes out of style. <br /><br />Professional patient Argan indulges his eve
 ry ailment\, and schemes to marry off his daughter to a doctor to save on 
 medical bills. But she has another life in mind. With a fearless ensemble 
 directed by Broadway veteran Brandon J. Dirden\, this fiercely funny produ
 ction is about to prove that real life is what happens while you and your 
 family are making other plans.</p>
LOCATION:Todd Haimes Theatre\, 227 West 42nd Street\, New York NY 10036
END:VEVENT
