 goes out of style. <br /><br />Professional patient Argan indulges his eve
 ry ailment\, and schemes to marry off his daughter to a doctor to save on 
 medical bills. But she has another life in mind. With a fearless ensemble 
 directed by Broadway veteran Brandon J. Dirden\, this fiercely funny produ
 ction is about to prove that real life is what happens while you and your 
 family are making other plans.</p>
LOCATION:Todd Haimes Theatre\, 227 West 42nd Street\, New York NY 10036
END:VEVENT
